This plugin contains skills forked from the following MIT-licensed upstream repositories:

- Owl-Listener/designer-skills (https://github.com/Owl-Listener/designer-skills)
  Copyright (c) 2026 MC Dean
  Used for: design-token, accessibility-audit, motion-system, typography-scale

- agents-inc/skills (https://github.com/agents-inc/skills)
  Copyright (c) 2025 Vincent
  Used for: shadcn-ui-composition (from src/skills/web-ui-shadcn-ui/)

The ui-ux-pro-max skill is an original BRIDGE file (no upstream content vendored).
It points to the standalone `impeccable` skill (Apache-2.0, based on Anthropic's
frontend-design skill), which is installed and licensed separately.

The taste-skills-bridge and design-eng-bridge skills are original BRIDGE files
(no upstream content vendored). They point to, respectively:

- Leonxlnx/taste-skill (https://github.com/Leonxlnx/taste-skill), MIT
- emilkowalski/skills (https://github.com/emilkowalski/skills), MIT
  Copyright (c) 2026 Emil Kowalski

Those libraries are installed separately via `npx skills add` (see the
/taste-skills and /design-eng-skills commands) and are governed by their own
license terms.

